'''Slimy''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
Its blade and guard are dark gray in color, and the handle is solid black. Coating the knife is thick, gooey green slime, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*During the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]], [[Mr. Skelly (NPC)|Mr. Skelly]] could be seen holding this knife in the Daily Challenges section.

